{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122581","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122581/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122581/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122581/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122581","id":5190502841,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAQLSmA","number":122581,"title":"Fix area monitoring order and excess allocations","user":{"login":"Schnorg","id":44937651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTM3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44937651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg","html_url":"https://github.com/Schnorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-08-19T08:15:15Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T22:05:45Z","closed_at":"2026-08-19T22:01:24Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122581","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122581","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122581.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122581.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #86640\r\n- Alternative to #120966\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n[Sort monitored_bodies in area2d queries - #120966](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120966) finds and fixes #86640 by sorting overlap detection records before notifying callbacks of the overlaps. \r\n\r\nI think this is an important fix, but the merge sort does more work than necessary. It only needs to make sure that ENTERED signals are issued before EXIT signals. \r\n\r\nThis PR offers an alternative which uses the loop that is already there and issues the callbacks in two passes, one for ENTERED, and the next pass for EXIT. \r\n\r\nHowever, there was an even bigger problem impacting this same code, which is that the HashMap was using the default allocator, causing potentially 100's or even 1000's of unnecessary allocations and frees every physics frame.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds static PagedAllocators to the HashMaps in GodotArea2D and Area2D to eliminate the excess allocation thrashing. The PagedAllocators are shared between object instances (otherwise the total memory allocated for overlap reporting might grow to $n^2$ instead of $n$).\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Schnorg","id":44937651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTM3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44937651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg","html_url":"https://github.com/Schnorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122581/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122581/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}